    "metadata": {
      "title": "FortiOS SSL VPN 路径穿越（凭据读取）",
      "cve": "CVE-2018-13379",
      "severity": "critical",
      "source_cvss": "9.8",
      "product": "Fortinet FortiOS (SSL VPN web portal)",
      "versions": "5.4.0-5.4.12、5.6.3-5.6.7、6.0.0-6.0.4",
      "ports": "443, 10443",
      "keywords": "fortinet, fortigate, fortios, sslvpn, path-traversal, fgt_lang",
      "verified": "false",
      "sources": "NVD / 厂商公告 / 公开分析（见文末参考）"
    },
    "metadata_origin": "uploaded-archive-frontmatter",
    "source_sections": {
      "fingerprint": true,
      "preconditions": true,
      "remediation": true,
      "references": true
    },
    "remediation_source": "- 升级到 5.4.13 / 5.6.8 / 6.0.5 及以上；**升级后改所有 VPN 账号口令**（漏洞期内的凭据已泄露）。\n- 临时：关闭 SSL VPN Web 门户（`config vpn ssl settings` → `set port 0`）；WAF 拦 `fgt_lang` 里的 `..`。",
    "reference_notes": "- NVD CVE-2018-13379；Fortinet 公告 FG-IR-18-384。",
    "mirror_url": "https://github.com/sanjiu2024/dsh-team-workflow/blob/c55070e2858c1677bbebaf6ec1e8f13dad366cd6/skills/kb-edge-device/cve-2018-13379-fortinet-fortios.md"
